{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEN4X5gA9avWSoBxT3Lr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I split the system prompt into two cached blocks so a `save_fact` write only re-caches the per-athlete tail. Whether the static block is actually cached is still unconfirmed, and that needs a live API check.\n\n**The change** is in `build_system()` in `bot.py`. The static instructions are now their own block with a cache marker. The per-athlete tail (date, profile, zones, goal, facts, language) is the second block, also with a marker. Offline checks passed: the instructions block is byte-identical across two athletes, two days, and a fact write, and the tail changes after the write.\n\n**The risk:** Anthropic won't cache a prefix shorter than the model's minimum, which is 1024 tokens for Sonnet-class models. My estimate is that the static prefix (core tools plus instructions) is just under that. If so, the first marker is silently ignored and a memory write still evicts everything. The guide's numbers have the same problem, so I didn't trust them. I didn't call the API because there's no key in this environment and I didn't deploy.\n\n**To settle it:** send a message, then a `save_fact` message, within 5 minutes, and read the next entry in `logs/usage.jsonl`. If `cache_creation_input_tokens` is only the tail (roughly 100–300 tokens), it works. If it's near the full prompt (1000+), the static block is below the minimum. The fix then is to add useful content to the static block, not filler.\n\nTool-group changes still evict the whole prefix, since tools sit above the system prompt. I left that alone because it's outside the `save_fact` problem.\n\nThe details, including the verification steps, are in `ANSWER.md`. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1447,"cache_read_input_tokens":35500,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1447},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f6036320-5761-49bf-a806-dd6950f24637","uuid":"d328cfca-9bad-4fcb-8bdf-8069d579c87b","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:33:51.265Z","request_id":"req_011CgEN4WqYH12sVDVzepXQj"}
